---
description: PostgreSQL/Prisma correctness rules
globs: "prisma/**,src/db/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Before changing persistence semantics, read `architecture.storage` and the relevant resolver/ingestion module.

Database uniqueness, NOT NULL, transaction boundaries, run snapshots, identifier version guards and promotion/failure atomicity are correctness contracts. Do not weaken constraints to work around application errors. Schema changes require committed Prisma migrations. Do not let pooled Prisma queries own the long-lived advisory lock.
